:52:52','2025-05-25 04:52:52'),(28,'chat_plugin_code','<script>...</script>','Mã nhúng chat Facebook/Zalo','2025-05-25 04:52:52','2025-05-25 04:52:52'),(29,'maintenance_mode','1','Chế độ bảo trì (0 = hoạt động, 1 = bảo trì)','2025-05-25 04:52:52','2025-05-25 07:13:42'),(30,'primary_color','#8b5cf6','Màu chính','2025-05-25 07:29:33','2025-08-16 13:27:10'),(31,'gradient-start','#5b21b6','Màu nền cho header 1','2025-05-25 07:29:33','2025-08-17 04:29:34'),(32,'gradient-end','#a78bfa','Màu nền cho header 2','2025-05-25 07:29:33','2025-08-16 13:26:36'),(33,'header_color','#ae6161','Màu thanh header (tuỳ chọn)','2025-05-25 07:29:33','2025-05-25 14:09:49'),(34,'text_color','#111827','Màu chữ chính','2025-05-25 07:29:33','2025-08-16 13:23:52');
